sequenceDiagram
  participant Ledger as Fee/Route Ledger
  participant Wash as Anti-wash Worker
  participant Epoch as Rewards Epoch Builder
  participant Policy as Policy Snapshot
  participant Safe as Treasury Safe
  participant RD as RewardsDistributor
  participant User as User
  participant Dash as Dashboard

  Ledger->>Wash: expose unprocessed route events
  Wash->>Wash: classify organic / excluded / review
  Wash->>Ledger: mark eligibility finalized
  Epoch->>Ledger: read eligible volume + fees
  Epoch->>Policy: read policy hash and splits
  Epoch->>Epoch: build deterministic snapshot
  Epoch->>Epoch: build Merkle leaves with sourceTag
  Epoch->>Safe: queue publishEpoch transaction
  Safe->>RD: publishEpoch(root,totalReal,totalIncentive)
  Epoch->>RD: fund rewards or verify funded state
  User->>Dash: request claim proof
  Dash->>Epoch: fetch proof
  User->>RD: claim(epoch,account,asset,amount,sourceTag,proof)
  RD->>User: transfer reward asset
  Dash->>Dash: show claimed + source-tag history
